{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把每条链表的当前头节点放入最小堆，每次取出堆顶的最小值，并把它的后继节点加入堆中。这样堆里始终最多只有 k 个候选节点，示例会依次选出 1、1、2、3、4、4、5、6。设节点总数为 N，时间复杂度为 O(N log k)，额外空间复杂度为 O(k)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>合并 K 个升序链表</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:600}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-top:8px}.hint{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}.lists{display:grid;gap:6px}.list-row{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.list-name{width:36px;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.node,.heap-node,.out-node{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;min-width:40px;padding:4px 6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px}.node small,.heap-node small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.node.head{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.node.used{background:#2d2d30;border-color:#3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}.arrow{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.heap,.output{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-height:40px;align-content:flex-start}.heap-node.min,.out-node.latest{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;font-size:12px}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff}.complexity{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.metric{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px}.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}</style></head><body><main><section class=\"panel\"><h1>最小堆维护各链表的当前候选</h1><div class=\"hint\">示例：lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]]</div></section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>三条升序链表</h2><div id=\"lists\" class=\"lists\"></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>当前头节点</span><span>灰暗节点：已经合并</span></div></section><section class=\"stage\"><div class=\"panel\"><h2>堆中的候选 (按值展示, 非堆数组顺序)</h2><div id=\"heap\" class=\"heap\"></div></div><div class=\"panel\"><h2>已生成的升序链表</h2><div id=\"output\" class=\"output\"></div></div></section><section class=\"panel\"><div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div></section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>复杂度</h2><div class=\"complexity\"><div class=\"metric\">每个节点进堆、出堆各一次<br><span class=\"mono\">时间 O(N log k)</span></div><div class=\"metric\">堆中至多保存每条链表的一个节点<br><span class=\"mono\">空间 O(k)</span></div></div></section></main><script>const source=[[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]],order=[0,1,2,1,0,1,0,2],names=['L₀','L₁','L₂'];let step=0;function positions(){const p=[0,0,0];for(let i=0;i<step;i++)p[order[i]]++;return p}function render(){const p=positions(),chosen=step?order[step-1]:-1;document.getElementById('lists').innerHTML=source.map((list,li)=>'<div class=\"list-row\"><span class=\"list-name\">'+names[li]+'</span>'+list.map((v,i)=>'<span class=\"node '+(i<p[li]?'used':i===p[li]?'head':'')+'\">'+v+'<small>'+(i<p[li]?'已取出':i===p[li]?'当前头':'等待')+'</small></span>').join('<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>')+'</div>').join('');const candidates=source.map((list,li)=>p[li]<list.length?{v:list[p[li]],li}:null).filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>a.v-b.v||a.li-b.li);document.getElementById('heap').innerHTML=candidates.length?candidates.map((x,i)=>'<span class=\"heap-node '+(i===0?'min':'')+'\">'+x.v+'<small>'+names[x.li]+(i===0?' · 堆顶':'')+'</small></span>').join(''):'<span class=\"hint\">候选已全部取完</span>';const values=order.slice(0,step).map((li,i)=>source[li][order.slice(0,i).filter(x=>x===li).length]);document.getElementById('output').innerHTML=values.length?values.map((v,i)=>'<span class=\"out-node '+(i===values.length-1?'latest':'')+'\">'+v+'</span>').join('<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>'):'<span class=\"hint\">等待取出第一个堆顶</span>';const status=document.getElementById('status');if(step===0)status.textContent='初始化：把 1、1、2 三个头节点放入最小堆。';else if(step<order.length)status.textContent='取出 '+values[values.length-1]+' (来自 '+names[chosen]+'), '+(p[chosen]<source[chosen].length?'把后继 '+source[chosen][p[chosen]]+' 加入堆.':'该链表已耗尽, 不再入堆.');else status.textContent='堆已为空，所有节点合并完成。动画即将重新开始。'}render();setInterval(()=>{step=(step+1)%(order.length+1);render()},1800);</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
